    "description": "Narrow general service place-of-supply stage for a synthetic HU supplier. Requires a reviewed GENERAL_SERVICE classification, reviewed special-rule exclusion screen, customer status/location evidence, and the applicable fixed-establishment boundary gate. No VAT collection, exemption, reverse charge, invoicing, or reporting conclusion.",
